title: Cancel on the closing question keeps the app open and usable: more typing, a save, and then it closes without asking
folders: edit-odd
limit: 40
forbid-log: cannot edit
forbid-log: nothing offers
expect-log: saved .*a\.txt
expect-file: edit-odd/a.txt :: (?-i)\AONETWOfirst of a\nsecond of a\n\z

wait 3000
goto a.txt
wait 800
edit a.txt 1 1
type ONE
quit
wait 1000
answer Cancel
wait 600
mark after-cancel
wait 400
type TWO
wait 300
mark typed-after-cancel
wait 400
key save
wait 600
quit
